  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Initial Assessment of Potential Hawksbill Nesting Beaches on the Tres Marias Archipelago</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will organize a five member field team to travel to Las Marias Islands for two weeks in August to conduct nesting surveys and conduct interviews with local residents to assess population status of hawksbillnesting and foraging populations and threats.</narrative>
  </description>
